'''Clockwork''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Chronosapien]]<ref>[[Rook Blonko]]</ref><ref name="AJftP">''[[A Jolt From the Past]]''</ref> from an unknown planet.

==Appearance==
Described as a "steampunk robot made by an insane watchmaker",{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/8/89/Ben_10k_Returns_DRAFT-1.pdf ''Ben 10,000 Returns'' Script First Draft]|group = script}} Clockwork is a robot-like alien with skin that is made of golden metal, with black stripes and a key on top of his head. His face has a blank expression, and he has a transparent piece of green glass-like material on his chest, revealing the gears inside of him.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', 16-year-old Clockwork has a larger body and holes on the key on his somewhat restructured head. There is a black stripe on his back that splits into two stripes with a keyhole between them.

11-year-old Clockwork has a thinner and rounder head, a white and black shirt, a smiley face, and a circular piece of glass-like material similar to his original appearance. His color scheme and gears are a little different too.

Clockwork wears the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]/[[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]]/[[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest.

